    {
     "claim": "K_paid",
     "type": "established",
     "claim_text": "Her supplier paid her to carry cocaine and drug cash through crew checkpoints at LAX and JFK (AP, at her plea: she acknowledged earning thousands of dollars to help smuggle drugs and money through security). Narration: 'She'd been paid to carry cocaine and cash.' Evidence close-up: our own typed record card ('ROUTE: LAX <-> JFK', 'CARRIED: COCAINE + CASH', 'SCREENING: CREW LANE'), not a real badge or document. The count of runs (six per DOJ/ABC7, nine per AP) is not narrated.",
